{"alias":"/about/languageassistance","title":"Language Assistance","changed":"2026-04-06T23:01:14+00:00","before":"<p style=\"margin-top: 3px;\"><strong>Language Assistance Phone Number</strong>: (207) 624-6629<br />\r\nTTY - 711 (Maine Relay 711)<br />\r\n<a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"c42a4b44-8db0-4f3a-a8bc-4bbaa36619e7\" filename=\"Language Assistance - Website Version - 2.2.2024.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Language%20Assistance%20-%20Website%20Version%20-%202.2.2024.pdf\">Download PDF Guide</a></p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"MsoTableGrid\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse; border:none\" width=\"100%\">\r\n\t<tbody>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:360px; padding:0in 7px 0in 7px; height:197px\" valign=\"top\">\r\n\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span class=\"TitleChar\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri Light&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.5pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size:22.0pt\"><span style=\"color:#274f73\">English</span></span></b></span></span><br />\r\n\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">If you need language assistance to contact the Maine Department of Education, call (207) 624-6629.</span></span></span></span><br />\r\n\t\t\t<br />\r\n\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Say your preferred language and wait for assistance or leave a voice message in your preferred language and someone will call you back.</span></span></span></span><br />\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<hr /></td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:25px; padding:0in 7px 0in 7px; height:197px\" valign=\"top\">\r\n\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:347px; padding:0in 7px 0in 7px; height:197px\" valign=\"top\">\r\n\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span class=\"TitleChar\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri Light&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.5pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size:22.0pt\"><span style=\"color:#274f73\">Chinese (Mandarin)</span></span></b></span></span><br />\r\n\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">如果您在联系缅因州教育部时需要语言协助，请致电</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"> (207) 624-6629.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">请说明您的首选语言并稍后接听帮助，或者用您的首选语言留下语音消息，会有人回电给您</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">.</span></span></span></span><br />\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<hr /></td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:360px; padding:0in 7px 0in 7px; height:197px\" valign=\"top\">\r\n\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span class=\"TitleChar\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri Light&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.5pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size:22.0pt\"><span style=\"color:#274f73\">Portuguese</span></span></b></span></span><br />\r\n\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Se precisar de assistência linguística para entrar em contato com o Departamento de Educação do Maine, ligue para (207) 624-6629.</span></span></span></span><br />\r\n\t\t\t<br />\r\n\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Diga o seu idioma de preferência e aguarde o atendimento ou deixe uma mensagem de voz no seu idioma de preferência e alguém retornará a sua ligação.</span></span></span></span><br />\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<hr /></td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:25px; padding:0in 7px 0in 7px; height:197px\" valign=\"top\">\r\n\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:347px; padding:0in 7px 0in 7px; height:197px\" valign=\"top\">\r\n\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span class=\"TitleChar\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri Light&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.5pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size:22.0pt\"><span style=\"color:#274f73\">Lingala</span></span></b></span></span><br />\r\n\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Soki ozali na mposa ya lisungi ya lokota mpo na kosolola na departema ya mateya ya Maine, benga (207) 624-6629.<br />\r\n\t\t\t<br />\r\n\t\t\tLoba lokota oyo olingi mpe zela lisungi to tika nsango na mongongo na lokota oyo olingi mpe moto moko akobenga yo.</span></span></span></span><br />\r\n\t\t\t<br />\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<hr /></td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:360px; padding:0in 7px 0in 7px; height:197px\" valign=\"top\">\r\n\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span class=\"TitleChar\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri Light&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.5pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size:22.0pt\"><span style=\"color:#274f73\">Arabic</span></span></b></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<p align=\"right\" style=\"text-align:right\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span dir=\"RTL\" lang=\"AR-SA\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">إذا كنت بحاجة إلى مساعدة لغوية للاتصال بإدارة التعليم في ولاية ماين، اتصل بالرقم 6629-624-207</span></span></span></span></span><br />\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<p align=\"right\" style=\"text-align:right\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span dir=\"RTL\" lang=\"AR-SA\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">أبلغ ما هي لغتك المفضلة وانتظر المساعدة أو اترك رسالة صوتية بلغتك المفضلة وسيتصل بك شخص ما.</span></span></span></span></span><br />\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<hr /></td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:25px; padding:0in 7px 0in 7px; height:197px\" valign=\"top\">\r\n\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:347px; padding:0in 7px 0in 7px; height:197px\" valign=\"top\">\r\n\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span class=\"TitleChar\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri Light&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.5pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size:22.0pt\"><span style=\"color:#274f73\">Vietnamese</span></span></b></span></span><br />\r\n\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Nếu quý vị cần trợ giúp về ngôn ngữ để liên lạc với Sở Giáo dục Tiểu bang Maine, vui lòng gọi số (207) 624-6629.</span></span></span></span><br />\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Nói vào điện thoại bằng thứ tiếng quý vị muốn sử dụng và chờ được trợ giúp hoặc để lại tin nhắn bằng thứ tiếng mà quý vị dùng. Sẽ có người gọi lại cho quý vị</span></span></span></span><br />\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<hr /></td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:360px; padding:0in 7px 0in 7px; height:197px\" valign=\"top\">\r\n\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span class=\"TitleChar\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri Light&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.5pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size:22.0pt\"><span style=\"color:#274f73\">Spanish; Castilian</span></span></b></span></span><br />\r\n\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Si necesita la asistencia de un intérprete para comunicarse con el Departamento de Educación de Maine, llame al (207) 624-6629.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Indique cuál es el idioma de su preferencia y espere para que le den asistencia, o deje un mensaje de voz en el idioma de su preferencia y alguien le devolverá la llamada.</span></span></span></span><br />\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<hr /></td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:25px; padding:0in 7px 0in 7px; height:197px\" valign=\"top\">\r\n\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:347px; padding:0in 7px 0in 7px; height:197px\" valign=\"top\">\r\n\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span class=\"TitleChar\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri Light&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.5pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size:22.0pt\"><span style=\"color:#274f73\">Kinyarwanda</span></span></b></span></span><br />\r\n\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Niba ukeneye ubufasha bwindimi mu kuvugana na Ishami rishinzwe Uburezi muri Maine, hamagara (207) 624-6629.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Vuga ururimi wifuza maze utegereze ubufasha cyangwa usige ubutumwa bw’ijwi mu rurimi wifuza hanyuma umuntu azaguhamagara.</span></span></span></span><br />\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<hr /></td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:360px; padding:0in 7px 0in 7px; height:197px\" valign=\"top\">\r\n\t\t\t<p><br />\r\n\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span class=\"TitleChar\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri Light&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.5pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size:22.0pt\"><span style=\"color:#274f73\">French</span></span></b></span></span><br />\r\n\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Si vous avez besoin d'une assistance linguistique pour contacter le Ministère de l'Éducation du Maine, appelez le (207) 624-6629.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Prononcez la langue de votre choix et attendez qu’on vous assiste ou laissez un message vocal dans la langue de votre choix et quelqu'un vous rappellera.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:25px; padding:0in 7px 0in 7px; height:197px\" valign=\"top\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:347px; padding:0in 7px 0in 7px; height:197px\" valign=\"top\">\r\n\t\t\t<p><br />\r\n\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span class=\"TitleChar\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri Light&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:-0.5pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size:22.0pt\"><span style=\"color:#274f73\">Central Khmer</span></span></b></span></span><br />\r\n\t\t\t<span lang=\"AR-SA\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Leelawadee UI&quot;,sans-serif\">សិនបើអ្នកត្រូវការជំនួយផ្នែកភាសាដើម្បីទាក់ទងនាយកដ្ឋានអប់រំរដ្ឋ</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Maine </span><span lang=\"AR-SA\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Leelawadee UI&quot;,sans-serif\">សូមទូរស័ព្ទទៅលេខ</span></span><span lang=\"AR-SA\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"> (</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">207) 624-6629 </span><span lang=\"AR-SA\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Leelawadee UI&quot;,sans-serif\">។</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"AR-SA\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Leelawadee UI&quot;,sans-serif\">និយាយភាសាដែលអ្នកប្រើ</span></span> <span lang=\"AR-SA\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Leelawadee UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ហើយរង់ចាំជំនួយ</span></span> <span lang=\"AR-SA\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Leelawadee UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ឬផ្ញើសារជាសំឡេងជាភាសាដែលអ្នកប្រើ</span></span> <span lang=\"AR-SA\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Leelawadee UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ហើយនឹងមានគេហៅទូរស័ព្ទទៅអ្នកវិញ</span></span> <span lang=\"AR-SA\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Leelawadee UI&quot;,sans-serif\">។</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n","after":"<div class=\"doe-hero\">\n<p class=\"doe-eyebrow\">About</p>\n<p class=\"doe-lead\"><strong>Language Assistance Phone Number</strong>: (207) 624-6629 TTY - 711 (Maine Relay 711) <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Language%20Assistance%20-%20Website%20Version%20-%202.2.2024.pdf\">Download PDF Guide</a></p>\n\n</div>\n\r\n\r\n<table class=\"table table-bordered\" width=\"100%\">\r\n\t<tbody>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"height:197px\" valign=\"top\">\r\n\t\t\t<p><span><span><span><span class=\"TitleChar\"><strong>English</strong></span><br />\r\n\t\t\tIf you need language assistance to contact the Maine Department of Education, call (207) 624-6629.</span></span></span></p>\n<p>Say your preferred language and wait for assistance or leave a voice message in your preferred language and someone will call you back.\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<hr /></td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"height:197px\" valign=\"top\">\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"height:197px\" valign=\"top\">\r\n\t\t\t<p><span><span><span><span class=\"TitleChar\"><strong>Chinese (Mandarin)</strong></span><br />\r\n\t\t\t如果您在联系缅因州教育部时需要语言协助，请致电 (207) 624-6629.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<p>请说明您的首选语言并稍后接听帮助，或者用您的首选语言留下语音消息，会有人回电给您.\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<hr /></td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"height:197px\" valign=\"top\">\r\n\t\t\t<p><span><span><span><span class=\"TitleChar\"><strong>Portuguese</strong></span><br />\r\n\t\t\tSe precisar de assistência linguística para entrar em contato com o Departamento de Educação do Maine, ligue para (207) 624-6629.</span></span></span></p>\n<p>Diga o seu idioma de preferência e aguarde o atendimento ou deixe uma mensagem de voz no seu idioma de preferência e alguém retornará a sua ligação.\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<hr /></td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"height:197px\" valign=\"top\">\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"height:197px\" valign=\"top\">\r\n\t\t\t<p><span><span><span><span class=\"TitleChar\"><strong>Lingala</strong></span><br />\r\n\t\t\tSoki ozali na mposa ya lisungi ya lokota mpo na kosolola na departema ya mateya ya Maine, benga (207) 624-6629.</p>\n<p>Loba lokota oyo olingi mpe zela lisungi to tika nsango na mongongo na lokota oyo olingi mpe moto moko akobenga yo.</span></span></span>\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<hr /></td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"height:197px\" valign=\"top\">\r\n\t\t\t<p><span><span><span><span class=\"TitleChar\"><strong>Arabic</strong></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<p align=\"right\" style=\"text-align:right\"><span><span><span><span dir=\"RTL\" lang=\"AR-SA\">إذا كنت بحاجة إلى مساعدة لغوية للاتصال بإدارة التعليم في ولاية ماين، اتصل بالرقم 6629-624-207</span></span></span></span>\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<p align=\"right\" style=\"text-align:right\"><span><span><span><span dir=\"RTL\" lang=\"AR-SA\">أبلغ ما هي لغتك المفضلة وانتظر المساعدة أو اترك رسالة صوتية بلغتك المفضلة وسيتصل بك شخص ما.</span></span></span></span>\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<hr /></td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"height:197px\" valign=\"top\">\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"height:197px\" valign=\"top\">\r\n\t\t\t<p><span><span><span><span class=\"TitleChar\"><strong>Vietnamese</strong></span><br />\r\n\t\t\tNếu quý vị cần trợ giúp về ngôn ngữ để liên lạc với Sở Giáo dục Tiểu bang Maine, vui lòng gọi số (207) 624-6629.</span></span></span>\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<p>Nói vào điện thoại bằng thứ tiếng quý vị muốn sử dụng và chờ được trợ giúp hoặc để lại tin nhắn bằng thứ tiếng mà quý vị dùng. Sẽ có người gọi lại cho quý vị\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<hr /></td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"height:197px\" valign=\"top\">\r\n\t\t\t<p><span><span><span><span class=\"TitleChar\"><strong>Spanish; Castilian</strong></span><br />\r\n\t\t\tSi necesita la asistencia de un intérprete para comunicarse con el Departamento de Educación de Maine, llame al (207) 624-6629.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<p>Indique cuál es el idioma de su preferencia y espere para que le den asistencia, o deje un mensaje de voz en el idioma de su preferencia y alguien le devolverá la llamada.\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<hr /></td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"height:197px\" valign=\"top\">\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"height:197px\" valign=\"top\">\r\n\t\t\t<p><span><span><span><span class=\"TitleChar\"><strong>Kinyarwanda</strong></span><br />\r\n\t\t\tNiba ukeneye ubufasha bwindimi mu kuvugana na Ishami rishinzwe Uburezi muri Maine, hamagara (207) 624-6629.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<p>Vuga ururimi wifuza maze utegereze ubufasha cyangwa usige ubutumwa bw’ijwi mu rurimi wifuza hanyuma umuntu azaguhamagara.\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<hr /></td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"height:197px\" valign=\"top\">\r\n\t\t\t<p><span><span><span><span class=\"TitleChar\"><strong>French</strong></span><br />\r\n\t\t\tSi vous avez besoin d'une assistance linguistique pour contacter le Ministère de l'Éducation du Maine, appelez le (207) 624-6629.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<p>Prononcez la langue de votre choix et attendez qu’on vous assiste ou laissez un message vocal dans la langue de votre choix et quelqu'un vous rappellera.</p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"height:197px\" valign=\"top\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"height:197px\" valign=\"top\">\r\n\t\t\t<p><span><span><span><span class=\"TitleChar\"><strong>Central Khmer</strong></span><br />\r\n\t\t\t<span lang=\"AR-SA\">សិនបើអ្នកត្រូវការជំនួយផ្នែកភាសាដើម្បីទាក់ទងនាយកដ្ឋានអប់រំរដ្ឋ</span> Maine <span lang=\"AR-SA\">សូមទូរស័ព្ទទៅលេខ</span><span lang=\"AR-SA\"> (</span>207) 624-6629 <span lang=\"AR-SA\">។</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<p><span><span><span><span lang=\"AR-SA\">និយាយភាសាដែលអ្នកប្រើ</span> <span lang=\"AR-SA\">ហើយរង់ចាំជំនួយ</span> <span lang=\"AR-SA\">ឬផ្ញើសារជាសំឡេងជាភាសាដែលអ្នកប្រើ</span> <span lang=\"AR-SA\">ហើយនឹងមានគេហៅទូរស័ព្ទទៅអ្នកវិញ</span> <span lang=\"AR-SA\">។</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n\r\n\n<p class=\"doe-top\"><a href=\"#top\">Back to top</a></p>","notes":[],"decisions":[{"id":"deck","on":true,"label":"Use this paragraph as the page description","why":"It is the page’s own opening paragraph, moved into the banner rather than rewritten.","value":"Language Assistance Phone Number: (207) 624-6629 TTY - 711 (Maine Relay 711) Download PDF Guide"},{"id":"eyebrow","on":true,"label":"Eyebrow: \"About\"","why":"Taken from the parent page, /about."}],"mechanical":["empty paragraphs removed: 5","b/i to strong/em: 20","drupal entity attrs stripped: 4","cell padding handed back to the stylesheet: 15","inline layout styles stripped: 134","tables normalised to the house shape: 1","table cells released from fixed